# Tools for development and CI. After changing this file, run `make lock` to
# rebuild requirements-dev.txt, the full lock file with hashes.
-r requirements.in
# Use exactly the versions the app ships with (requirements.txt), so the
# tests run against the very packages that go into the Docker image.
-c requirements.txt

# Testing
